🚨 New findings in the devastating Black Altadena, California wildfires point to Edison equipment as the cause. Investigators say electrical sparks from a local transmitter tower allegedly ignited the blaze. ⚠️

@mimibrowntv speaks with NAACP Pasadena President @bdlamar about what the findings mean for the community on Front Page News.

Tap in as @mimibrowntv has the latest details on this developing story in Front Page News. 📰
